-- Unemployment rate per country from Eurostat une_rt_a (percentage of the labour
-- force aged 15-74, all sexes, annual). "Netherlands unemployment, 2024?" could
-- only reach the dataset catalogue search: statistics.eurostat-data needs the
-- dataset and country codes, which nobody types. As with the GDP contracts, the
-- codes are fixed per capability and only the year is an input (optional).
-- Samples are Eurostat's own responses for each query (time=2024), fetched
-- 2026-09-25 from the same origin the endpoint calls.

BEGIN;

